2026-11-13T04:15:22.0499529Z # dossier, so the run-specific facts live in profiles instead of being
2026-11-13T04:15:22.0500430Z # re-derived per cycle.  A profile is selected by the --run-id argument
2026-11-13T04:15:22.0501354Z # (either the resuming run or the resumed snapshot) and falls back to
2026-11-13T04:15:22.0502208Z # ``DEFAULT_PROFILE_KEY`` so the original pinned behaviour is unchanged.
2026-11-13T04:15:22.0503178Z # Everything a profile does NOT override (posture, accepted pointer, frozen
