2026-11-13T04:17:58.6775933Z                 "WERE downloadable in the producing cycle (HTTP "
2026-11-13T04:17:58.6776334Z                 f"{snapshot.get('logs_endpoint_status')}) and are committed "
2026-11-13T04:17:58.6776768Z                 "beside this diagnosis, so the log-level cause is observable "
2026-11-13T04:17:58.6777400Z                 "and is classified by the lane-cycle log-evidence artifact "
2026-11-13T04:17:58.6777811Z                 "built with product/lane_cycle_log_evidence.py. This "
2026-11-13T04:17:58.6778219Z                 "instrument reports only the orchestration facts (step "
2026-11-13T04:17:58.6778651Z                 "conclusions, durations) and observed no work-quantum expiry "
2026-11-13T04:17:58.6779091Z                 "(quantum_expired=false); no provider, auth or token cause "
2026-11-13T04:17:58.6779450Z                 "is asserted here."
2026-11-13T04:17:58.6779685Z             )
