2026-11-13T04:19:23.2894115Z """Operational resume 43349050225: verify the v68 P0 leg and hand off to audit.
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2894454Z 
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2894678Z The resumed run 43348787378 persisted a team ref byte-identical to the prior
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2895192Z producer commit (``7cca4708``), so it added no product delta and the chain of
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2895702Z no-audit diagnosis cycles continued.  The substantive v68 P0 work was already
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2896210Z accepted in cycle 40284658455 (gate PASS, accept commit ``7be4480e``); what
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2896743Z was missing is the *verification* that the accepted bytes still satisfy the
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2897535Z ordered-work P0 rule, an enforced check for that rule, and a fresh
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2897947Z audit-readiness dossier keyed to this executing run.
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2898185Z 
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2898349Z This test pins the resume without re-diagnosing accepted work:
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2898610Z 
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2898809Z * the resumed snapshot is honestly recorded as ZERO_DURABLE_DELTA with an
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2899315Z   UNOBSERVED mechanism (no public run/jobs snapshot was reachable) and is
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2899687Z   UNADJUDICATED;
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2900008Z * the ordered-work (2) success rule re-derives from the *current* committed
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2900489Z   fixed-path family: 49 bundles / 4900 decisions / 55 verified rows / 0
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2900973Z   verified-and-defective, no D2/D3/D4 defects, the known sound row retained
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2901432Z   and 0 false rejects (REPORTED-ONLY; no frozen bar is scored);
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2901889Z * ``content_family_probe.py --check`` is an *enforced* command: it fails when
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2902377Z   the rule is unmet instead of printing ``met: False`` and exiting 0;
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2902855Z * the end-to-end offline slice still builds a source-linked clickable map plus
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2903339Z   a sourced answer from the cached OpenCaseLaw fixture with no network;
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2903811Z * the accepted pointer is advanced to the latest accept commit (40284658455 /
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2904251Z   ``7be4480e``) and satisfies both halves of requirement 4;
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2904692Z * posture stays fail-closed and the producer wrote no auditor-namespace path.
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2905066Z """
