2026-11-13T04:19:23.2913746Z """Cycle 43357207555: break the zero-delta chain with a shipped product fix.
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2914042Z 
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2914229Z Run 43356960891 resumed snapshot ``696cd4b7`` and, like its predecessors
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2914901Z 43356503308 and 43349050225, persisted a team ref byte-identical to that same
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2915707Z commit.  The workflow therefore had no audit half again.  This resuming cycle
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2916409Z does not re-diagnose the already-accepted v68 P0 leg; it adds a *durable
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2917097Z product delta* discovered by exercising the shipped progressive server:
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2917472Z 
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2917624Z     a late ``expand`` job could overwrite an ``enrich`` result
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2917866Z 
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2918010Z so ``/api/query/status`` said ``answer.status=ready`` while
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2918420Z ``/api/query/bundle`` returned ``answer.status=pending``.  The fix is a
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2918865Z monotonic stage guard in ``product/query_app.py`` (``first_page`` /
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2919301Z ``map_ready`` < ``map_expanded`` < ``complete``); a lower stage may never
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2919646Z replace a higher one.
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2919785Z 
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2919868Z Pinned here:
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2919980Z 
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2920175Z * the resumed snapshot really is a zero-delta, unobserved, unadjudicated
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2920564Z   orchestration outcome (no invented cause);
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2920958Z * the stage guard refuses the exact losing write and the real regression file
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2921389Z   ``product/tests/test_query_app_stage_guard.py`` exists;
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2921794Z * the v68 fixed-path family still re-measures cleanly on current bytes;
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2922238Z * the end-to-end offline slice still answers from the cached fixture;
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2922674Z * the accepted pointer still satisfies both halves of requirement 4;
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2923120Z * posture stays fail-closed and the producer minted no auditor artifact.
2026-11-13T04:19:23.2923466Z """
